Package: bankwarn
Title: Bank-Failure Early Warning on FDIC Call Report Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tajaddin", "Gafarov", email = "gafarovtajaddin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds CAMELS-style features from FDIC Call Report ratios, labels each
    bank-quarter by whether the bank failed within a year of the data becoming
    public, fits a logistic early-warning model on one period and evaluates it on a
    later one, and exports the model (coefficients and clipping bounds) so that SQL
    engines can score banks exactly as R does.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
    arrow,
    jsonlite,
    stats
Suggests:
    covr,
    lintr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
